stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Resolve: Primary click or secondary menu
    Resolve --> Unavailable: Missing source payload or disabled integration
    Resolve --> Ready: Source identity and configured path produce action
    Unavailable --> [*]: No command; keep launcher open
    Ready --> Dispatch: Injected process, application or compositor adapter
    Dispatch --> Failed: Adapter throws
    Failed --> [*]: Propagate error; keep launcher open
    Dispatch --> Submitted: Adapter returns
    Submitted --> [*]: Close launcher
    note right of Submitted
        Detached command submission does not confirm
        application completion or later process success.
    end note
